// Random : the clock at "q" and the trigger "g" (1 : a rising edge) : 1 at a tick ; a trigger restarts the clock (the phase
// 0, a new interval) ; rate 0 : the triggers only ; q[10] the phase of the mode Smooth : 0 at a tick, then at the speed of
// the clock or of the triggers, the faster (q[7] the samples since the last trigger, q[8] the inverse of that interval :
