/*
    Math : "ccnt" channels, the operation (its_Mt...) on A (its source 1, times its gain) and B (its source 2, times its
    gain : one channel per channel, or its first channel for all, fx[its_Efx_St1] ; no source B : the value Par5,
    modulated) ; then offset + scale x the result (both modulated) ; the slots of a channel : 0 the state of Env (the
    envelope), Gate (1 : open), Slew (the value) ; header : 0 1 the attack (ms) and its coefficient, 2 3 the release, 4 5
    the steps of Slew (up, down : a unit in "attack", "release" ms)
