);

/*
    Ring : "ccnt" channels ; A (its source 1, times its gain) and the carrier : B (its source 2, times its gain : one
    channel per channel, or its first channel for all, fx[its_Efx_St1]), else the oscillator (Par1 Hz, modulated in
    octaves ; channel c : + c x detune Hz, its phase + c x spread turns ; its shape Par8) ; Ring : A x the carrier ; AM :
    A x (1 - amount (1 - the carrier) / 2) ; Up, Down : A analytic (its_Rg_Hilb) times the analytic carrier (the oscillator
    Sine : cos and -sin, exact ; else the carrier through the network too), the sum or the difference frequencies only ;
    then the mix with A
