    its_Tb_v3 ... its_Tb_v6), -1 if unknown ; the writer : "direction" is a number in mode W-Mix (key 11), else
    Forward|Backward|Both (key 13) ; the reader : "curve" and "follow" take "none" (-1 : linear ramps, a free loop) ; the
    offset takes all the actions of the mode Delay (and doppler : modes Delay and Read)
